<http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#AnalogicalMapping> <http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#promptExtractionText> "Extract Metaphorical and Analogical Mapping elements from the image. Metaphorical and Analogical Mapping includes: symbolic representations, analogical elements, metaphorical connections, symbolic mappings, figurative elements, and analogical relationships. For each metaphorical element found, provide: 1) A descriptive instance_name (e.g., 'fire_metaphor', 'smile_analogy'), 2) A natural language label (e.g., 'the fire metaphor', 'the smile analogy'), 3) A brief description of the metaphorical or analogical meaning. Focus on how one element represents or symbolizes another concept. Example output format: {\"instance_name\": \"fire_metaphor\", \"label\": \"the fire metaphor\", \"description\": \"The burning house serves as a metaphor for chaos or destruction, contrasting with the girl's calm expression\"}"@en .
_:nc16d0f36373e49da9b4619e02a33496ab67 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#unionOf> _:nc16d0f36373e49da9b4619e02a33496ab68 .
