<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01472#cultural_norms> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Social rules or expectations that govern behavior within a particular culture. The meme contrasts the cultural norm in the woman's home country (where wearing the hijab is common) with the cultural norms in other countries (where she is free to choose whether to wear it)."@en .
