<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01472#individual_autonomy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The right of an individual to make their own choices and decisions, especially regarding personal beliefs and lifestyle. The meme emphasizes that the woman has the freedom to choose whether to wear the hijab, regardless of her location, highlighting the importance of personal choice."@en .
