<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01472#woman_in_cafe> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A woman wearing a beige hijab, black turtleneck, and colorful patterned jacket is seated in what appears to be a cafe. She is looking directly at the camera with a neutral expression, her right hand near her collar. In the background, there is a black bag and a glass jar with a red-and-white striped straw. The scene is casual and relaxed, with natural lighting from a window."@en .
