<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01472#religious_freedom> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The concept that individuals have the right to practice their religion or not, without coercion or discrimination. The meme references this concept by stating that the woman is free to wear the hijab in other countries, implying a contrast with potential restrictions in her home country."@en .
