<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01472#religious_dress> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Clothing worn for religious reasons, often as a sign of devotion or identity. The hijab is a form of religious dress, and the meme uses it to discuss the broader concept of religious attire and its role in personal and cultural expression."@en .
