<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01472#global_citizenship> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The idea that individuals are members of a global community and have rights and responsibilities that extend beyond their national borders. The meme implies that the woman, as a global citizen, is entitled to exercise her religious freedom wherever she goes, regardless of local cultural norms."@en .
